{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19649","headline":"奉和李相公早朝於中书候传点偶书所怀奉呈门下武相公中书郑相公 · 吕温","name":"奉和李相公早朝於中书候传点偶书所怀奉呈门下武相公中书郑相公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"禁门留骑吹，内省正衣冠。\n稍辨旗常色，尚闻钟漏残。\n九天鑪气煖，六月玉声寒。\n宿雾开霞观，晨光泛露盘。\n致君期反朴，求友得如兰。\n政自同归理，言成共不刊。\n准绳临百度，领袖映千宫。\n卧鼓流沙静，飞航涨海安。\n尽规詶主意，偕赋代交欢。\n雅韵人间满，多慙窃和难。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕温","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19649.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19649","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}